{"id":"b1rbl03ydgt413rukxmz32gg5","title":"IMF建议肯尼亚引入加密货币旅行规则","originalTitle":"IMF敦促肯尼亚引入加密货币旅行规则，要求平台共享客户信息","summary":"国际货币基金组织（IMF）11月6日发布技术援助报告，建议肯尼亚要求加密平台收集汇款人及收款人身份信息。该建议针对肯尼亚《虚拟资产服务提供商法》2025年11月生效后的监管缺口，IMF要求将旅行规则义务纳入VASP法规或其他法律文件。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1c507-6a33-7775-930a-7dc081449ea6"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T10:35:59.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:49:04.210Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T10:49:04.210Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布"],"score":87,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"830074a5-07c3-4027-bd47-0a1182b174c3","title":"IMF建议肯尼亚加密监管纳入旅行规则义务"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"830074a5-07c3-4027-bd47-0a1182b174c3","title":"IMF建议肯尼亚加密监管纳入旅行规则义务"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fkMWBlBgfVpw","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}